summary:
  The alarm's station box falls back to the first station after every reload.

history:
  The shared station list reloads by clear-and-append. A plain combo went
  empty there; one that only refuses to be empty would quietly move every
  half-made alarm to the first station in the list.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StationPicker.qml

find:
          if (i >= 0) currentIndex = i

replace:
          if (i >= 0) currentIndex = 0

expect:
  Killed by tst_stationpicker::test_the_listeners_pick_survives_a_reload.
  Line-neutral.
